  "description": "FUZBAH crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C44 H87 Co3 N6 O26 Sm2,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 9 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 9 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 2.829-4.221 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.88-119.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C44H87Co3N6O26Sm2 (desolvated analytical formula). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
